<Layout title="Privacy information" simpleFooter>
  <article class="legal-page"><p class="eyebrow">Clear by design</p><h1>Your <em>privacy.</em></h1><p>This notice describes the current website and local journey planner. It is not a booking-service privacy notice.</p><h2>Your journey brief</h2><p>The planner processes the information you type within the current page in your browser. It does not send your entries to Pardus, an email provider, a CRM or an analytics service. Downloading creates a text file on your device. Treat that file as personal information if it contains your name or travel plans.</p><h2>Browser storage</h2><p>The site uses a session-only browser flag called “pardus-opening-v2” to remember whether the logo introduction has played. It contains no traveller information and is not used for tracking. Journey entries are not saved in localStorage or sessionStorage. Browser form-restoration behaviour may vary.</p><h2>Hosting and assets</h2><p>Fonts, images and scripts are served with the website. We have not added analytics, advertising pixels or third-party tracking scripts. The hosting provider may process routine request information, such as your IP address and browser details, to deliver the site under its own policies.</p><h2>Future enquiry delivery</h2><p>If online enquiries or other services are connected, this notice will need to identify the responsible business, approved contact channel, service providers, purposes, retention arrangements and applicable privacy rights before that processing begins.</p><h2>What not to enter</h2><p>Please do not enter passport numbers, payment details, passwords or sensitive medical information in this general planning tool.</p></article>
</Layout>
